WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.690
At eight on a Monday, a voice

2
00:00:02.690 --> 00:00:04.510
note from the head teacher went

3
00:00:04.510 --> 00:00:05.750
round the parents' group.

4
00:00:06.260 --> 00:00:08.980
School closed, it said, and fees

5
00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:10.940
due today by mobile money.

6
00:00:11.570 --> 00:00:13.570
The head teacher was at her desk.

7
00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:16.050
She had never recorded it.

8
00:00:17.260 --> 00:00:19.780
Today: how a school responds when

9
00:00:19.780 --> 00:00:22.520
AI goes wrong, step by step.

10
00:00:23.740 --> 00:00:25.200
AI incidents at school

11
00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:26.460
come in a few kinds.

12
00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:30.300
Personal data pasted into a public tool.

13
00:00:30.890 --> 00:00:32.770
A fake of a teacher or a pupil.

14
00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:35.860
A chatbot giving harmful advice.

15
00:00:36.630 --> 00:00:38.230
Or an agent that acted

16
00:00:38.230 --> 00:00:39.510
without anyone's yes.

17
00:00:40.880 --> 00:00:43.400
When one happens, act in order.

18
00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:46.400
First, contain it: stop the

19
00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:48.320
tool, ask for the post to come

20
00:00:48.320 --> 00:00:49.800
down, change the password.

21
00:00:50.510 --> 00:00:53.530
Then protect people: warn parents on

22
00:00:53.530 --> 00:00:55.650
the channel they already trust, and

23
00:00:55.650 --> 00:00:57.250
support anyone targeted.

24
00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:00.500
Next, keep the evidence without

25
00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:03.340
spreading it: note the time, the

26
00:01:03.340 --> 00:01:05.260
sender and where it appeared.

27
00:01:05.940 --> 00:01:07.380
Report it to your school's

28
00:01:07.380 --> 00:01:08.780
lead, and to the provider.

29
00:01:09.490 --> 00:01:11.770
And if personal data leaked, many

30
00:01:11.770 --> 00:01:13.630
laws expect the regulator to hear

31
00:01:13.630 --> 00:01:15.070
within seventy-two hours.

32
00:01:16.460 --> 00:01:19.040
The last step is the one schools skip.

33
00:01:19.780 --> 00:01:22.160
Ask what let it happen, and fix

34
00:01:22.160 --> 00:01:23.600
that, not just the symptom.

35
00:01:24.260 --> 00:01:26.680
After our voice-note scare, we

36
00:01:26.680 --> 00:01:29.320
agreed a code word for any money

37
00:01:29.320 --> 00:01:31.540
request, and told every family.

38
00:01:32.740 --> 00:01:33.220
Quick check!

39
00:01:33.830 --> 00:01:36.270
A teacher tells you she pasted a

40
00:01:36.270 --> 00:01:38.810
class list with health notes into a

41
00:01:38.810 --> 00:01:41.050
public chatbot an hour ago.

42
00:01:41.700 --> 00:01:43.120
What's the first step?

43
00:01:44.270 --> 00:01:46.770
Contain it: delete the chat and its

44
00:01:46.770 --> 00:01:48.850
history, and turn training off.

45
00:01:49.530 --> 00:01:51.210
Then the data lead decides

46
00:01:51.210 --> 00:01:52.530
who must be told.

47
00:01:53.070 --> 00:01:55.650
And thank the teacher: if people are

48
00:01:55.650 --> 00:01:58.170
blamed, the next mistake stays hidden.

49
00:01:59.450 --> 00:02:01.030
Don't wait for the real thing.

50
00:02:01.760 --> 00:02:03.180
Run a twenty-minute drill each

51
00:02:03.180 --> 00:02:05.420
term: read out an incident and

52
00:02:05.420 --> 00:02:07.340
let staff decide each step.

53
00:02:07.970 --> 00:02:11.230
Then teach pupils the short version: stop,

54
00:02:11.770 --> 00:02:14.130
don't share it, tell a trusted adult.

55
00:02:15.380 --> 00:02:18.220
In the app, eight messages arrive by text,

56
00:02:18.480 --> 00:02:22.180
chat and email, some real and some scams.

57
00:02:22.800 --> 00:02:25.880
Use them as a drill: for each one, decide,

58
00:02:25.880 --> 00:02:28.900
then say what you'd report and to whom.

59
00:02:29.510 --> 00:02:31.130
Notice that the scams have

60
00:02:31.130 --> 00:02:32.110
perfect spelling.

61
00:02:33.430 --> 00:02:34.190
Your turn.

62
00:02:34.810 --> 00:02:37.030
A fake picture of a pupil is

63
00:02:37.030 --> 00:02:38.290
spreading in a class group.

64
00:02:38.970 --> 00:02:40.270
Who do we help first?

65
00:02:41.580 --> 00:02:43.660
The pupil in the picture comes first.

66
00:02:44.440 --> 00:02:46.980
Remember: contain it, protect

67
00:02:46.980 --> 00:02:49.580
people, keep evidence and report,

68
00:02:49.580 --> 00:02:52.700
then learn and fix the cause.

69
00:02:53.970 --> 00:02:56.330
Try it at school this week: run a

70
00:02:56.330 --> 00:02:58.030
twenty-minute drill at a staff meeting.

71
00:02:58.660 --> 00:03:01.100
Read out the fake voice-note story and

72
00:03:01.100 --> 00:03:02.920
let each table decide the steps.

73
00:03:03.620 --> 00:03:06.200
Write the agreed steps on one card,

74
00:03:06.620 --> 00:03:07.920
and pin it up in the staffroom.
